Field Type Description <code>from</code> <code>int</code> Source abstraction index. <code>to</code> <code>int</code> Target abstraction index. <code>label</code> <code>str</code> Description of data flow, invocation, or structural dependency. <p>Example Value: <pre><code>{
    "summary": "Core workflow graph orchestrating AST extraction and chapter synthesis.",
    "details": [
        {"from": 1, "to": 2, "label": "routes execution tasks"},
        {"from": 2, "to": 8, "label": "provides verified facts"}
    ]
}
</code></pre></p>
